           "ancient times...\r"
           "So many have tried again and again,\n"
           "only to fail...\r"
           "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, your heart in complete\n"
           "harmony with the Tidal Bell has finally\f"
           "allowed it to appear...\r")
